00:04:51.210 --> 00:04:56.980
should consider this it's like no this is
my how dare you this is my baby but with time

00:04:56.980 --> 00:05:05.290
and you know it's like all right that makes
sense you know more receptive to to the feedback

00:05:05.290 --> 00:05:09.840
have you ever given it to someone and you
